 Can See Everything\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mVh3qkw2NUFxWWyF0G1hg2Wh0K5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rrbbzCyS45yooXpUGJatfptlHYI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Thirty-four days before she's sent to prison, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into the abyss.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1612018,\"title\":\"Jackass: Best and Last\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tfgccePxnswMqhmtxafliLlcCVR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dUbP1HNdI0aCq1zgRJw28PWSqmk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The fifth and final installment to Jackass franchise where the crew go on one last insane crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1755291,\"title\":\"NAZA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cbxiZ1l21KUATu2KKQQ8J8fJhpe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/inju8joDtL7KHtlFEGjFZ2UuqFa.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Filmed at night from Tel Aviv rooftops, this investigative documentary examines the civilian casualties of Israel's military operations in Gaza and the systems behind targeted killings of Palestinians.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":899082,\"title\":\"Harry Potter 20th Anniversary: Return to Hogwarts\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jntLBq0MLR3hrwKaTQswxACRPMs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8rft8A9nH43IReybFtYt21ezfMK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An enchanting making-of story told through all-new in-depth interviews and cast conversations, inviting fans on a magical first-person journey through one of the most beloved film franchises of all time.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1022256,\"title\":\"Selena Gomez: My Mind & Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oMpsswJv8x4vnOnIKqs4xJs2Kn3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u3MWQCdHyCK7IADtat4sVmBXd9U.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After years in the limelight, Selena Gomez achieves unimaginable stardom. But just as she reaches a new peak, an unexpected turn pulls her into darkness. This uniquely raw and intimate documentary spans her six-year journey into a new light.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":664280,\"title\":\"David Attenborough: A Life on Our Planet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSKwyUDKDHiFU5syTTvQRDcGBPS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hHL4pwGzYS4njLpXhIjfc9skAQJ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of life on our planet by the man who has seen more of the natural world than any other. In more than 90 years, Attenborough has visited every continent on the globe, exploring the wild places of our planet and documenting the living world in all its variety and wonder. Addressing the biggest challenges facing life on our planet, the film offers a powerful message of hope for future generations.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396194,\"title\":\"Ennio\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lEuLAubp74HYztEyNYpEx3AoqOu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iytQNneOp4lNSKktRh9T6Fo3UXk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A portrait of Ennio Morricone, the most popular and prolific film composer of the 20th century, the one most loved by the international public, a two-time Oscar winner and the author of over five hundred unforgettable scores.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":324558,\"title\":\"X-Rated: The Greatest Adult Movies of All Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uYzHkzZPp84B7nHOKaJZWjyGFUL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gw6ZMxVbfOQcQahGsmwdvFJPOa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The evolution of adult cinema through the most influential films in history, a journey that begins in the 1970s and ends nowadays. An in-depth analysis of the success of the most prestigious erotic films, their impact on industry and society, and their influence on cinema and contemporary culture.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1412113,\"title\":\"Squid Game: Making Season 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQGaui0bQ5Ai3KIFBB45nTeIqad.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zecxlBpLx0aLIjNjX1IOZuaSgo0.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From set designs to character arcs, get exclusive cast and director interviews on how Season 2 of the globally most-watched series was brought to life.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1492608,\"title\":\"John Candy: I Like Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNEJdx9WSXeyMmkuQfTeY4zouNx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rSuqSerMzqMtgX7fX50Hl55ficF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Those who knew iconic funnyman John Candy best share his story, in their own words, through never-before-seen archival footage, imagery, and interviews.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":656690,\"title\":\"The Social Dilemma\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jcaM6V2tCtu6iMHDsGLBUbaYgYp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iYqoT9VBGdGTuLl3cjfbG7ZXDkP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This documentary-drama hybrid explores the dangerous human impact of social networking, with tech experts sounding the alarm on their own creations.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1633264,\"title\":\"Louis Theroux: Inside the Manosphere\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ouOvRvsgF37yEx3D6ZLWyuxZFjE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cmpiLnDIdxQNFZLZZFRj1rSo7fW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With rare access and no holds barred, the acclaimed documentarian investigates a growing ultra-masculine network and its controversial influencers.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"k5fQ1sYHv68\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"p4uaiFEnZCk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"PYgId3FTXQY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}